      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. The coding sheet is divided into three parts - upper, middle and lower. The upper and lower are for the internal use of the Mayor's Correspondence Division. The middle area only is for your use. It is extremely important that your office confine its attention to this area exclusively.",
