      "text": "3. In this middle section there are two subjects:\nTermination of Action and Explanation of Action. Choose one of the five alternatives in each category which describes the action taken in response to the communication. The number corresponding to the action taken should be written in the proper box. When using choice 5, briefly describe the circumstances not covered.",
